  displayNameTurkish: "Da\u011F evi teras\u0131"
  descriptionTurkish: "Da\u011F evinin \xF6n\xFCnde, karl\u0131 zirvelere bakan teras:
    beton ayaklar, kiri\u015Fler, d\xF6\u015Feme alt\u0131 kiri\u015Fleri, melez
    d\xF6\u015Feme."
  tipsTurkish:
  - "Oraya kamyonetle git (at\xF6lye avlusunda durur). Malzeme \u015Fantiyeye teslim
    edilir; aletlerini al (kemerde ya da kamyonet kasas\u0131nda), gerekirse merdiveni
    de."
  - "K\xF6\u015Fe kaz\u0131\u011F\u0131nda alan\u0131 i\u015Faretle, ayak yerlerini
    haz\u0131rla, a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131dan yukar\u0131 kur; m\xFC\u015Fteri her a\u015Famay\u0131
    denetler (k\xF6\u015Fe kaz\u0131\u011F\u0131nda E)."
  - "Bitince i\u015Fi evin kap\u0131s\u0131nda m\xFC\u015Fteriye teslim et."
